/-!
# Candidate-A H10--H14 from a principal Gårding operator plus a bounded perturbation

The augmented Hessian is naturally assembled as an elliptic graph operator and
bounded physical terms.  This façade therefore accepts a reference operator
with a named-mode Gårding estimate and a bounded perturbation whose norm is
strictly smaller than the reference coercivity constant.  The full Gårding
estimate, actual-kernel gap and H10--H14 terminal certificate are derived.
-/

namespace JanusFormal
namespace P0EFTJanusProgramPGlobalHessianCanonicalSixPerturbativeGardingFrontier4D

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 12400000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 6200000

noncomputable section

open Set Topology MeasureTheory
open scoped Manifold ContDiff InnerProductSpace
open P0EFTJanusMappingTorusQuotient
